OL,3,GNEWSAHero air raid warden was first to
OL,4,Abe awarded George Cross
OL,5,
OL,6,FBridlington still bears scars from the
OL,7,Fair raids of World War Two. There are
OL,8,Fsmall square repair marks on the
OL,9,Fpillars of the old bank, on King
OL,10,FStreet, where the stone was peppered
OL,11,Fwith shrapnel.
OL,13,FAbove a bargain shop, on Prince Street,
OL,14,Fold red bricks flow into brighter,
OL,15,Fnewer ones. It was rebuilt after a bomb
OL,16,Fhit the former Woolworths. The store
OL,17,Fand Foley's cafe, next door, collapsed.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
