OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHero air raid warden was first to
OL,4,Abe awarded George Cross
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is also a brass plaque, about the
OL,7,Fsize of an A4 sheet of paper. Though
OL,8,Fsmall, it is dedicated to a man and his
OL,9,Fteam who demonstrated enormous
OL,10,Fdetermination and bravery.
OL,12,FThomas Hopper Alderson led the town's
OL,13,FARP (Air Raid Precautions) team. They
OL,14,Frisked their lives to tunnel by hand
OL,15,Funder bombed buildings and rescue
OL,16,Fpeople trapped inside.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
